{"id":"truco","lemma":"truco","pos":"noun","rank":1324,"glosses":["gimmick, ploy (something designed to fool or swindle)","piece of a magician's act","effective way of doing something"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾuko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trucos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-truco.wav","examples":[{"text":"No es un truco.","en":"It's not a trick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77631"},{"text":"Los monos pueden aprender un montón de trucos.","en":"Monkeys can learn a lot of tricks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831069"},{"text":"Eso es un truco.","en":"That's a gimmick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443671"},{"text":"Se me agotaron los trucos.","en":"I'm all out of tricks."},{"text":"¿Dónde está el truco?","en":"Where's the catch?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75838"}]}